                        "target_lang_word": "adrenaline",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "adrenaline",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f796ecab-dcdb-3408-bcf0-cc342dc33bbf",
                                        "entry_id": "9a31de23-1d8e-382e-aad1-df20d6374920",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Epinephrine, the hormone and neurotransmitter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "493f3da1-141b-3d35-b48f-04a3fc951198",
                                        "entry_id": "9a31de23-1d8e-382e-aad1-df20d6374920",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excitement; thrills."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7714f948-17c2-4c41-b83a-5450e5513190",
                                                "sense_id": "493f3da1-141b-3d35-b48f-04a3fc951198",
                                                "text": "Some people bungee jump to feel alive through the surge of adrenaline."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33ccbd2c-c7e8-4c65-8a54-9dc583a59188",
                                                "sense_id": "493f3da1-141b-3d35-b48f-04a3fc951198",
                                                "text": "May be it's not as heavy as he thought, or may be he's on adrenaline overdrive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ea16743-64ee-489e-b754-b2c3092d6735",
                                                "sense_id": "493f3da1-141b-3d35-b48f-04a3fc951198",
                                                "text": "Despite the crisis, the adrenaline that must have been feeding his own alarm, Tim managed to maintain his control and spoke in a subdued tone, assuring the tenderman and all of us that things would be okay."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cfde33f4-cd85-4497-b1f1-155277dc0c08",
                        "source_entry_id": "859f943d-1edc-30b3-a7ba-3679633fab2c",
                        "source_sense_description": "гормон",
                        "target_lang_word": "adrenalina",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "adrenalina",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64b9a44b-8ae7-3eb0-a44f-f015ca810abc",
                                        "entry_id": "6a8c7dff-5fb1-3af2-902b-f26018f281e5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hormona vasoactiva catecolamínica que secreta la médula adrenal de los mamíferos, movida por el sistema parasimpático, en situaciones de alerta. Estimula el flujo sanguíneo hacia ciertos tejidos musculares e incrementa la cantidad de glucosa en la sangre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3530c23e-4368-4f37-a903-5d8c86f9f999",
                        "source_entry_id": "859f943d-1edc-30b3-a7ba-3679633fab2c",
                        "source_sense_description": "гормон",
                        "target_lang_word": "adrenalina",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "adrenalina",
                                "target_lang_code": "it",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b11358fb-5f5b-3d0f-a87e-e8c8d0da3b43",
                                        "entry_id": "2567559f-4fd7-3dec-9cef-e8bdd8bac471",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "principio ormonico attivo delle ghiandole surrenali, che si prepara anche sinteticamente e produce un aumento della pressione, della capacità di lavoro dei muscoli e del metabolismo generale"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ad022a2-ef37-4bff-976c-fc835eeba4db",
                        "source_entry_id": "859f943d-1edc-30b3-a7ba-3679633fab2c",
                        "source_sense_description": "гормон",
                        "target_lang_word": "Adrenalin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Adrenalin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3cae010f-94f3-3833-bc8c-aa8b5200bd14",
                                        "entry_id": "5687b858-4083-3414-8a8f-62be0f1a7623",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein bei Stress ausgeschüttetes Hormon des Nebennierenmarks"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ff50185-4846-4e02-b036-b24885055a50",
                                                "sense_id": "3cae010f-94f3-3833-bc8c-aa8b5200bd14",
                                                "text": "„Aber Adrenalin floss und ich war dankbar.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50cf6d0a-ccb0-433f-a579-b4c7a6d60fab",
                                                "sense_id": "3cae010f-94f3-3833-bc8c-aa8b5200bd14",
                                                "text": "„Die Nebennieren produzieren mehr Adrenalin und die Bauchspeicheldrüse mehr Insulin.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cf63b02-8213-4ac6-a65a-e40c1a71066b",
                                                "sense_id": "3cae010f-94f3-3833-bc8c-aa8b5200bd14",
                                                "text": "„Sensationsgier, der Begleiter jeder Gefahr, bei der man selbst nicht in Gefahr ist, schoß aus tausend Nebennieren Adrenalin in das Blut der Zuschauer.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec68de79-4690-4560-872c-76564be2240a",
                                                "sense_id": "3cae010f-94f3-3833-bc8c-aa8b5200bd14",
                                                "text": "„Das Adrenalin schoss durch seinen Körper.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4acfb1ad-467d-4bf1-9f02-b0d1552c3180",
                                                "sense_id": "3cae010f-94f3-3833-bc8c-aa8b5200bd14",
                                                "text": "Der Körper schüttet Adrenalin aus."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a23fb87-0e30-35b2-a9e5-9162eabe4960",
                                        "entry_id": "5687b858-4083-3414-8a8f-62be0f1a7623",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Notfallmedikament bei der Herz-Lungen-Wiederbelebung bei Herzstillstand, dem anaphylaktischen Schock und Vasokonstriktor"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Pharmakologie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7225699-7692-49c7-8df5-d8437f335936",
                                                "sense_id": "3a23fb87-0e30-35b2-a9e5-9162eabe4960",
                                                "text": "Der Körper schüttet Adrenalin aus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e90c3fbb-f016-4ea3-ae60-8065bcc6b0ed",
                                                "sense_id": "3a23fb87-0e30-35b2-a9e5-9162eabe4960",
                                                "text": "„Heute wird Adrenalin vor allem als Notfallmedikament eingesetzt – kann aber auch zu Dopingzwecken verwendet werden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d74d3b93-132c-450d-ae88-e17022272902",
                        "source_entry_id": "859f943d-1edc-30b3-a7ba-3679633fab2c",
                        "source_sense_description": "гормон",
                        "target_lang_word": "adrenaline",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "adrenaline",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "394ce98d-3445-32fc-a2cf-2e849e35028e",
                                        "entry_id": "05926ddf-0dea-3491-8f36-684cf7a0533b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een hormoon en een neurotransmitter die wordt geproduceerd in de bijnieren en in sommige zenuwcellen en vrijkomt bij angst en stress, maar ook bij woede, kou, hitte, pijn en fysieke arbeid"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43a7179b-97c6-4050-b1c7-e89e6b4fe994",
                                                "sense_id": "394ce98d-3445-32fc-a2cf-2e849e35028e",
                                                "text": "Olive had gezegd dat ze niet bang was, maar nu ze tussen de heuvels liep, kon ze zonder zaklamp geen hand voor ogen zien, en ze stond stijf van de adrenaline. Ze wist nauwelijks waar ze heen ging, maar ze nam aan dat hij niet al te ver weg kon zijn. Ze liep in de richting van de voetheuvels, daar zou ze hem vinden, dat moest gewoon. Denk je soms dat hij naar het noorden is, had Teresa gevraagd. Hij is niet naar het noorden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c3592a3-f27e-4c90-af94-d3ea4d32eefb",
                                                "sense_id": "394ce98d-3445-32fc-a2cf-2e849e35028e",
                                                "text": "‘Dit is het,’ fluisterde ik opgewonden in het duister. Vandaag zou ik de woestijn intrekken, een dorre vlakte die mij totaal vreemd was. De adrenaline gierde door mijn lijf omdat, na meer dan een jaar voorbereiding, mijn trektocht van Mexico naar Canada eindelijk begon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
